            </note>
            <note corresp="#d98-f2" n="97" xml:id="d98-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 6704 to London, repeated to Athens as telegram 799, <ref target="#pg134"
                        >p. 134</ref>. The statement was released on August 20.</p>
            </note>
